-- a report that carries the bath it was taken in: the material, the bath, the warrant the number rests on
-- with an inhabitant of it, and the value. This is the correction the whole section asks of the record,
-- and the bath is where the temperature, the instrument and everything dissolved sit.
BReport : Type 0 → Type 1
BReport V = (k : Material) × (v : Bath) × (W : Type 0) × W × V
